{"steam_appid":2245180,"steam_name":"VORON: Raven’s Story","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2245180/305432740/e8b2f78d28011f5e652d6a923ace5e8535be38a8/1761269344/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761300631","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257075611/00ad5d7479b178f84d66181ab1fcf073189ccb97/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761300631","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245180/bab9b2e3e005d8d1abf65dffcd26763b971fda31/ss_bab9b2e3e005d8d1abf65dffcd26763b971fda31.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782453002","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245180/657da57bebae27fcd5935cccf03b5b40184f1ff5/ss_657da57bebae27fcd5935cccf03b5b40184f1ff5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782453002","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245180/d0e242ffe68d7d77714804743ea28c69ead0d65a/ss_d0e242ffe68d7d77714804743ea28c69ead0d65a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782453002","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245180/32f1f3e510ea944744eef8c1016ee76d5098b985/ss_32f1f3e510ea944744eef8c1016ee76d5098b985.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782453002","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245180/7641e65d03f368458184134f4740ccb317c3e7e1/ss_7641e65d03f368458184134f4740ccb317c3e7e1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782453002"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flying feels amazing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While it’s easy to learn, it’s hard to master<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245180/extras/03e5325813cc4136e8a46f7cb88a423a.poster.avif?t=1782453002\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245180/extras/03e5325813cc4136e8a46f7cb88a423a.webm?t=1782453002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every collision is hilarious!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No health bars!</strong><br>Whatever happens, the raven is always ready to get up again and continue his journey!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245180/extras/60655d29aaba878ede74b35044460785.poster.avif?t=1782453002\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245180/extras/60655d29aaba878ede74b35044460785.webm?t=1782453002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Norse-inspired open world full of secrets!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245180/extras/3371676d0b9ff7224579b0aaa3c14ad1.poster.avif?t=1782453002\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245180/extras/3371676d0b9ff7224579b0aaa3c14ad1.webm?t=1782453002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Learn new abilities such as shooting thunder, performing aerobatics, and much more!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245180/extras/317a0268f74f20a4aa905f12ca88849b.poster.avif?t=1782453002\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245180/extras/317a0268f74f20a4aa905f12ca88849b.webm?t=1782453002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Solve puzzles and take on trials!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245180/extras/c2ee552f7f032fe079329f238ae44335.poster.avif?t=1782453002\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245180/extras/c2ee552f7f032fe079329f238ae44335.webm?t=1782453002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Help your family and friends!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245180/extras/ddfa51946a3316128464bb4be872259b.poster.avif?t=1782453002\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245180/extras/ddfa51946a3316128464bb4be872259b.webm?t=1782453002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>What is this story about?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the journey of a raven — from his very first flight to the end of his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After death, every soul must reach the World of Gods — that’s the law. But what if a soul can’t leave the Human World? In such cases, ravens guide the lost — and now it’s your duty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your path to the World of Gods, you and your family are attacked by an ancient evil force and separated. Help each soul, learn their stories, discover why they’re trapped, find your loved one, and reach the World of Gods before the world ends. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your own path with multiple endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><i>Feel free to stream or make videos about the game — I’d be honored to see your content!<br>You have my permission if you need it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ARE YOU READY TO TAKE OFF?</strong></h2>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4GHz CPU Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 780 / Radeon R9 290X<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2500 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Merk Games"],"publishers":["Merk Games"],"release_date":"Nov 10, 2025"}